<title>UK: S&amp;P rates Volkswagen EMTN A plus long-term.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P rates Volkswagen EMTN A plus long-term.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's rating agency said on Friday it had assigned a long-term rating of A plus to the 1.5 million mark multi currency euro medium-term note programnme of Volkswagen Financial Services.  </p>
<p>S&amp;P said the outlook for the rating was stable, reflecting the outlook for the parent company, Volkswagen AG.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 8682</p>
</text>
